stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> REQUESTED: tenant onboards a bank with no published version
    REQUESTED --> CAPTURED: sample template or specification supplied and stored
    CAPTURED --> DRAFT: columns, widths and control totals mapped onto the schema object
    CAPTURED --> WITHDRAWN: artefact cannot be validated and no tenant needs it
    DRAFT --> PROVING: dry run diffed against the supplied sample
    PROVING --> DRAFT: bank rejects the upload, reason kept verbatim as a template defect
    PROVING --> PUBLISHED: bank accepts and the batch reconciles, proving artefact stored
    PUBLISHED --> DRAFT: bank release changes the layout, a new version is minted
    PUBLISHED --> DEPRECATED: successor version reaches published
    DEPRECATED --> RETIRED: no open batch routes to this version
    RETIRED --> [*]
    WITHDRAWN --> [*]

    note right of PROVING
        Emission is permitted for one named tenant
        and one batch only
    end note
    note right of PUBLISHED
        Requires both a stored source artefact
        and a stored proving artefact
    end note
